    "Another VPN was already carrying this Mac's traffic when %@ tried to connect, so %@ couldn't take over. Disconnect the other one first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another VPN was already carrying this Mac's traffic when %1$@ tried to connect, so %2$@ couldn't take over. Disconnect the other one first."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein anderes VPN leitete bereits den Verkehr dieses Macs, als %1$@ verbinden wollte, deshalb konnte %2$@ nicht übernehmen. Trenne zuerst das andere."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un autre VPN acheminait déjà le trafic de ce Mac quand %1$@ a tenté de se connecter, donc %2$@ n'a pas pu prendre le relais. Déconnectez d'abord l'autre."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ が接続しようとしたとき、別の VPN がすでにこの Mac の通信を扱っていたため、%2$@ は引き継げませんでした。まず別の VPN を切断してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 尝试连接时，另一个 VPN 已在承载这台 Mac 的流量，因此 %2$@ 无法接管。请先断开另一个 VPN。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 嘗試連線時，另一個 VPN 已在承載這台 Mac 的流量，因此 %2$@ 無法接手。請先中斷另一個 VPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask whoever gave it to you for a profile that already includes the server's settings.": {
