    "Shown only while a connection is active. A crowded menu bar wants the icon alone; someone switching often wants to see which profile is up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shown only while a connection is active. A crowded menu bar wants the icon alone; someone switching often wants to see which profile is up."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur sichtbar, während eine Verbindung aktiv ist. Eine volle Menüleiste will nur das Symbol; wer oft wechselt, will sehen, welches Profil gerade läuft."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affiché uniquement pendant qu'une connexion est active. Une barre des menus chargée préfère l'icône seule ; quelqu'un qui change souvent veut voir quel profil est actif."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接続中のみ表示されます。メニューバーが混んでいればアイコンだけが望ましく、よく切り替える人はどのプロファイルが接続中か見たいものです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在连接活跃时显示。菜单栏拥挤时只显示图标更合适；经常切换的人则希望看到当前是哪个配置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅在連線進行中顯示。選單列擁擠時只顯示圖像較合適；經常切換的人則希望看到目前是哪個描述檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
